      <description># Hubble 2.0.20

- Workspaces affected by a router action save error automatically open for editing again after updating.
- Select SRC, Select DST, and Take can be saved without a routing group.
- The bundled Blackmagic Videohub and AJA KUMO modules now publish router readiness without reporting a shared-data error.</description>
